{"server":"cn","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_st03","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_st03","title":"《狂欢节章程》","storyCode":"PV-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"a25dd9cc71f73f54000b716b233a830069efdac067271aff14c6b83acace9123","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g11_newvolsiniipier"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月9日    12:05 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“吃饱了也要争最后一块”！披萨外送！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有小南瓜甜椒、奶酪、薯条香肠、什锦、魔鬼辣椒，还有最最经典的番茄奶酪口味！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家先来吃饭吧，肚子空空干活会没有力气的。这一份给您，大帝......抱歉，我还是叫您顾问吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"唔~口感不错，饼皮松软又有嚼劲，肉香浓郁。这家店的名片有吗？给我一张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我借了港口工人们的厨房自己做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，您要是喜欢的话，我可以把配方写给您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别不好意思，都是应该的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是您帮忙，赶在今晚巡游开始之前把所有受损的花车修复好，这种事我们根本不敢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想，龙门人吃不吃得惯正宗的叙拉古披萨。改天让能天使研究一下，说不定可以加进“大地的尽头”的菜单里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝顾问，那位边工作边唱歌的老师，不过来吃一点吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，大嘴巴，快过来，这里有东西能堵住你的嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"一时间不知道该吐槽你这个随时随地都要高歌一曲的臭毛病，还是你的破锣嗓子，又或者你唱的歌本身......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"这个调调是什么，你们在雨林里搭积木时的劳动号子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不唱我开心不起来，干活没劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肥仔，你只是悠哉地坐在一边提供所谓的“造型指导”，真正挥汗如雨跑上跑下敲敲打打的可是我大祭司！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你有卖力的理由，我没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"谁让你的花车在火场跟着遭了殃呢，啧，是屁股被烧掉了对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"气死我了气死我了，做得一点都不酷炫就算了，还把我和那只狼摆得那么近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警察小姑娘，其他断手断脚的花车基本修补好了，还剩下那只烧得就剩一堆渣渣的狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照我说，与其要在这么短的时间内重新造一辆出来，不如我再花点功夫把其他花车改造得更拉风一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正花车那么多，少一只狼肯定没人能看出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"有道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然叙拉古关于野兽的传说有很多，但狼有特殊的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且市政厅很早就宣传过花车的数量和原型，如果真的少了一辆，会引起不必要的恐慌的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，肥仔，不要直接往我嘴里塞——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，放了烤菠萝？有叛逆精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古的警察都要学做披萨吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊不是的。我爸爸在别的城市开了间披萨店，我从小就在里面打工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们店的口碑很好哦，小时候我梦到过我们在全叙拉古开了分店，甚至有一个专门的移动地块来做总部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许您听过我们的广告——“诺埃米披萨，让您吃饱了也要争最后一块！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝&大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们始终没攒够钱开第一家分店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然生意还不错，也没有客人敢逃单或者吃霸王餐，但给家族的保护费几乎就是我们全部的利润......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以听说新沃尔西尼警察学校招生，我就跑来了。当上警察了，说不定就可以保护店里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是不是也想说我的想法很幼稚？其实当警察比开分店难多了，这几天也确实接二连三出了好多事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"换个角度想问题，年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你当了警察，起码可以改一句更有辨识度更能刺激消费的广告词——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"“诺埃米披萨，不好吃你把我铐起来！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你让我想起我家祖玛玛了，年轻人总是想法很简单，也很有干劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，都怪你这肥仔，突然把我拉到这里来，我都没来得及跟祖玛玛说一声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"值得我们一聚的派对并不多，大嘴巴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，派对结束之后，咱们还有正经事要谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，还是感谢两位！要不是你们突然出现，还主动帮忙，我们真不知道该怎么办了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于报酬，等到狂欢节结束，我会第一时间向市政厅申请的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"报酬你刚刚已经付过了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"大帝又往嘴里塞了一块披萨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在披萨的分上，帮人帮到底。"},{"type":"narration","text":"大祭司又往嘴里塞了一块披萨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不过说真的，看着这蠢狼被烧得只剩一堆渣渣，真是没来由地解气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺埃米","speakerId":"avg_npc_1552_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"但我更讨厌派对被搞砸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，世事无常啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚一路过来，其他摊位都在热火朝天地布置，准备晚上大赚一笔，只有我们，被提前宣判了死刑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管，这次的损失你一个人承担。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犟嘴的合伙人","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这就有点耍无赖了啊，我当时也是好心啊！前天突然下了那么大一场雨，我想着能尽量减少点损失嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你放着晾在庭院里的食材不管，冲出去推啤酒车？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犟嘴的合伙人","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忙中出错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啤酒车有智能恒温系统，又是封闭的，被雨淋了也没什么，结果你把它推了回来，害得我好不容易抢到的摊位被别人占了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，摊位没了，食材没了，这哪是什么狂欢节，分明是我的葬礼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道就该继续拍电影，虽然那些家族的人动不动就来片场指手画脚，但好歹有口饭吃，非要听你这混蛋胡吹，跑来这儿——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犟嘴的合伙人","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你又来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz，Zzz......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来您还没走啊！怎么吃完一支冰淇淋后还原地睡着了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神父，神父？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我真想把您这副样子给拍下来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不拍呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果好看的话，我肯定愿意付钱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会拍照吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天可是新沃尔西尼最重要的日子，每个人都会盛装出席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假面、华服，还有巨大而神秘的花车，如果我身处其中，肯定会想拍几张照片留念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是游行的队伍滚滚向前，我根本没法为这件事停下来。这时候要是有个专业摄影师在一旁代劳，何乐而不为呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说到时候满大街都是卖啤酒卖冰淇淋的，你真不一定争得过人家——说实话，你们做的冰淇淋口味挺差的，不够甜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还愣着干什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犟嘴的合伙人","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧回去取相机，记得多买几卷胶片！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您。一条尾巴里容不下两种皮毛，看来我和这家伙真的不适合在一起打拼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问题总会暴露的，问题也总有解决的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得城里没有建教堂......神父，您从哪儿来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒙特卢佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首都啊......好远。专门赶过来参加狂欢节吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受一个老朋友的委托，过来看看。她对这个活动有些在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古确实好久没有哪座城市举行过这么盛大的活动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惆怅的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同样是庆祝新生，隔壁莱塔尼亚的女皇庆典可是一年一次，而且听说都是万民齐聚，排场一次比一次大......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，叙拉古好久没有哪座城市举行过这么盛大的活动了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要下雨才好，不然维持秩序可就难喽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......英格丽女士，你这是在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这块布料应该没用了吧？我从废布箱里随手拿的，用来擦一下刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以给你找一块质地更软些的纯棉布。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没那个必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天晚上就是狂欢节，几乎每条街上都安排了庆典活动，你就不用一直待在德蒙塔诺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答应了瓦古，要替你解决麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你查到了卢奇诺的下落，也是你陪我到威尼斯的宅邸接他回来。你帮的忙已经够多了，我应该对你表示感谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没必要谢我，翁贝托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说服了老威尼斯不再追究卢奇诺的人是你，你自己救回了那孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，那孩子还把自己关在房间里？一直没看见他，别又跑出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑出去就跑出去了吧，这两天经历了太多事情，他的年纪还小，总得花些时间来整理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许一直以来，我都把他管得太严了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许他只是一时间没法想清楚该怎么看待你，自己的爷爷，一个老裁缝，曾是让叙拉古的家族老大们都无法安眠的“剪裁师”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，并不重要。重要的是他从鬼门关走了这一遭，知道了这种种往事后，要怎么看自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又能陪他多久呢？他必须要想清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，英格丽女士，我们也就此告别吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实你已经知道了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年那个伤害了你女儿的凶手到底是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，为什么这么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，英格丽女士，你忘了，我也曾经是个杀手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的武器明明很锋利，不需要保养，你也没有类似的习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个杀手，突然擦拭自己的刀，要么是打算封存它，要么是准备用它去杀人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然还只是猜测，但也算是有了一些收获，所以我说你不用感谢我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来到新沃尔西尼，留在德蒙塔诺，是为了换取当年的真相——具体是谁策划了那场刺杀，在那场城邦内乱中伤害了丽萨小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你和瓦古的约定，但既然你已经知道了答案，它也就没了继续的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况我已经没有什么麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"游戏还没有结束，所谓的“獠牙”还在城内，我和她们交过手，两个孩子，但身手都不弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能找到她们，她们自然也能找到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翁贝托，你老了病了，以你现在的身体状况......你会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英格丽女士，那本来就是我快要走到的终点，你没法帮我避开它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起码今天晚上，我想安静地待一会儿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g11_newvolsiniipier"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月9日    4:00 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就先走了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，新面孔，之前那个调度员呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调度员","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......半小时前刚换班，他这会儿估计正在排练呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调度员","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不知道？人家以前可是米兰剧场的驻场乐手，吹得一手好萨克斯，狂欢节刚筹备的时候他就被邀请进花车的随行乐队了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调度员","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂了，他一直瞒着，就是想第二天拿着印着他照片的报纸向你们炫耀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以今晚是你值班吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调度员","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚来嘛。还好因为狂欢节，新沃尔西尼港今晚会进入特殊作业状态，没平时那么忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调度员","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把收音机开到最大，隔空感受一下现场的氛围，也算参与了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调度员","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们快走吧，不然在队伍里抢不到好位置了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调度员","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你差点说漏嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不你来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没在市长的就职宣传片里当过群演，没那个演技。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能一样？我在那里面演的是自己，再说随时能再拍一条，刚刚要是露馅，安东尼奥今晚的所有布置就都暴露了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚对你我，对整个威尼斯家族都很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我们真正掌控了这座城市，安东尼奥会兑现他的诺言，支持你......怎么说的来着，重振西西里的荣光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只希望自己不要和卡尔一个下场......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的顶级乐手呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在地狱里吹萨克斯呢——就是那边的集装箱，尸体等事情结束后再一并处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那接下来调度台就交给你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚港口内一应车辆的进出都必须接受调度台的特别审验，威尼斯载具公司的车临时加进了名单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"移动城市的定位系统已经关闭，只保留了一个加密频道。今晚除了家族的那艘陆行舰，所有载具都不能靠近这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的人手就在外围。一旦陆行舰到达城市附近，你这边开始接驳，新沃尔西尼港所有不相干的人都会消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安东尼奥那边呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板用得着我们操心吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有几个小时......享受今晚吧，新沃尔西尼人，享受真正的狂欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这开幕词太俗气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"声音来自头顶。\n集装箱上方的吊机横梁上，白狼饶有兴味地看着惊愕的两人。她皱眉撇嘴，像一个实在忍受不了演出而出声打断的观众。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？你一直在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“调度员”","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甘比诺，做了她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俗气你还鼓掌？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是给了我第一个小反转吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过甘比诺，我还挺期待你朝我动手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想。但我不做成功概率低到可以忽略不计的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，你的小伙伴呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡彭？帮着小威尼斯处理其他事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很忙嘛，西西里人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德，你到底要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经偷偷帮了你不少忙了，今天晚上，我没办法再——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小威尼斯已经把整个家族在新沃尔西尼一年的积累全部投了进来，事到如今，哪怕你要搞什么破坏，我也帮不上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是自以为很了解我啊，甘比诺。而且都是老熟人了，我怎么会为难你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照常执行你老板交代的任务就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他想做的事情和我想做的事情并不冲突，说不定我其实是想帮他一把呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狂欢节嘛，每个人对这座新城市的愿望都该被实现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你都不用打死地上这个家伙的——手太快了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次注意，别那么急着表现自己还是一个坏种，难怪你的市民积分攒得没卡彭多呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之前还有什么要我做的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有东西落在了威尼斯的宅邸，先去帮我取来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个礼盒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......难道说，是那个小裁缝随身带着的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，去多弄一些彩带气球和射灯什么的，快去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i26"},{"type":"narration","text":"漫长的狂欢节"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]}]}
